{"game": "risk-of-rain-2013", "language": "english", "appid": 248820, "month": "2017-11", "window": 4, "start_date": 1511395200, "end_date": 1512086399, "month_true_total": 302, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 09:13:56 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "37964114", "author": {"steamid": "76561198126841526", "personaname": "halfcafian", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/halfcafian/", "num_games_owned": 372, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 6844, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 819, "last_played": 1610218785, "avatar": "030e4c4ba75ad47b03343b274107b67a56bf3985"}, "language": "english", "review": "This is literally my favorite indie game, and probably my favorite video game of all time. With the ability to have multiple people play on the same computer at once with easy controls makes it a very friendly game to play when you have some friends over. It's also well worth exploring single player and becoming godlike to the creatures of the planet. The only thing that needs some work is the games online multiplayer, which I sincerely hope Hopoo gets to as it would make the games experience perfect.", "timestamp_created": 1512084273, "timestamp_updated": 1512084273, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "37962880", "author": {"steamid": "76561198115314828", "personaname": "Lunsííík", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/ravaxon/", "num_games_owned": 126, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 1860, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1544, "last_played": 1512409040, "avatar": "1454c7d29372359bf8b4b3f42b4158b837f41c9c"}, "language": "english", "review": "This is the one of those games where you have to play again and again to unlock new weapon, characters, learn how to use your character at its best, how to be save against those all enemies. Levels are huge and finding teleporter can be really painful, timer goes upper, so does difficulty. This is what i really like there, when you are playing longer, the game is getting harder, every 5minutes diffiulty goes up (up to 9 of that if i'm right). This isn't really for short play, you have to play long enough to even beat it for the 1st time. Really like challenge like this, 10 out of 10.", "timestamp_created": 1512079356, "timestamp_updated": 1512079356, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "37961692", "author": {"steamid": "76561198063799018", "personaname": "bullpup ツ", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/bullpup1337/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 161, "playtime_forever": 29, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 29, "last_played": 1512075314, "avatar": "80332dcaabfa33aeb87d41d9849421b3df53c954"}, "language": "english", "review": "Perhaps I don't get it, but I run around until I find a teleporter, and then I die. Game over.\nGuess if you are more skilled this might be fun.", "timestamp_created": 1512075392, "timestamp_updated": 1512075392, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.423705488443374634", "comment_count": 3, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "37956227", "author": {"steamid": "76561198286216705", "personaname": "Kanabuki", "p